  "benefits": "\n  - **Awareness Creation:** Farmers receive knowledge about horticulture schemes and technologies related to fruit, flower, vegetable, and spice crops.  - **Scheme Promotion:** Departmental schemes are publicized to ensure more participation and benefit utilization among farmers.\n<br>\n\n",
